   "text": "Benefits of Pearl AI in Dentistry:",
   "section": 6
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Time and Cost Efficiency: By automating repetitive tasks and streamlining workflows, Pearl AI saves time and reduces operational costs for dental practices, allowing practitioners to focus more on patient care.",
   "html": "<p><strong>Time and Cost Efficiency:&nbsp;</strong>By automating repetitive tasks and streamlining workflows, Pearl AI saves time and reduces operational costs for dental practices, allowing practitioners to focus more on patient care.</p>",
   "section": 6
  },
  {
   "type": "para",
   "text": "Patient Engagement and Satisfaction: Through personalized care and proactive interventions, Pearl AI fosters stronger patient-dentist relationships and enhances overall patient satisfaction.",
